                                "text": "Громилы захватили три кассовых ящика с деньгами и скрылись."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01da3f11-3c1d-4568-9a47-ac787c057e0b",
                                "sense_id": "8f434777-d5c1-3bb1-82c9-969c475be412",
                                "text": "У кассы образовалась очередь Репортер Персицкий, выпросивший небольшой аванс и ждавший открытия кассовых операций уже полчаса, поднял страшный шум."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "36776f46-6a4b-4b93-9665-92bec80fae2a",
                                "sense_id": "8f434777-d5c1-3bb1-82c9-969c475be412",
                                "text": "Бухгалтер разнимает, подпевая, пытаясь крутнуть ручку кассового счётчика, с которым он вертится, как с шарманкой."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "feda1dac-a290-404d-8e7a-8a34d709e1f5",
                                "sense_id": "8f434777-d5c1-3bb1-82c9-969c475be412",
                                "text": "Она поставила ношу у кассового окошечка, загороженного фанеркой, усадила на корзину запыхавшуюся бабку и, сама переводя дыхание, с приветливым добродушием оглядела публику."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8b647a22-92fb-4518-bb7d-747b2d8670d9",
                                "sense_id": "8f434777-d5c1-3bb1-82c9-969c475be412",
                                "text": "Через мгновение он срывается с места, и я несусь с ним в кассовый зал."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "53fd37d4-341c-3350-9e31-e49a459628f6",
                        "entry_id": "b8ff5fa9-0fcc-307e-8fec-3b76c34a4872",
                        "glosses": [
                            "перен. приносящий большой доход, большие денежные сборы"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "77a37feb-cf76-49aa-97aa-2892f7a54650",
                                "sense_id": "53fd37d4-341c-3350-9e31-e49a459628f6",
                                "text": "А то, что получилось у Леонида Гайдая и Александра Демьяненко в роли студента Шурика, вообще стало одним из лучших, и уж точно одним из самых кассовых фильмов Советского Союза."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ac44c475-fd0f-4a7b-8516-ab88b6584d44",
                        "source_entry_id": "b8ff5fa9-0fcc-307e-8fec-3b76c34a4872",
                        "source_sense_description": "связанный, соотносящийся по значению с существительным касса",
                        "target_lang_word": "cash",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cash",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bf509c89-d5ef-30ff-a102-ef2cde2835b1",
                                        "entry_id": "c22bfa5b-0241-3ecb-b356-835909005b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Money in the form of notes or bills and coins, as opposed to checks, credit or electronic transactions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "53ce9bd5-7cc7-4cfe-9c87-f31704424d5d",
                                                "sense_id": "bf509c89-d5ef-30ff-a102-ef2cde2835b1",
                                                "text": "After you bounced those checks last time, they want to be paid in cash."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b485162-fc5e-4cb5-acb9-1ba7f9ff1f82",
                                                "sense_id": "bf509c89-d5ef-30ff-a102-ef2cde2835b1",
                                                "text": "When a man bargains for the price of maintaining such or such principles, or of endeavouring to make out such or such a case, without believing in the soundness of the principles or the truth of the case; such a man, whether he touch the cash (or paper-money) before or after the performance of his work, and whether he work with his tongue or his pen, may, I think be fairly charged with seeking after \"base lucre;\" […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c884e8ec-3e3e-3946-998a-7c19d88a22ca",
                                        "entry_id": "c22bfa5b-0241-3ecb-b356-835909005b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Liquid assets, money that can be traded quickly, as distinct from assets that are invested and cannot be easily exchanged."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6ab7437c-0ca8-47e3-a020-b2e47183c20d",
                                                "sense_id": "c884e8ec-3e3e-3946-998a-7c19d88a22ca",
                                                "text": "Cash offers a return of virtually zero in many developed countries […]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6927e4b-b599-30f5-91f7-93cfd4b7cd24",
                                        "entry_id": "c22bfa5b-0241-3ecb-b356-835909005b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Money."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "informal",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cc9b6a96-8112-4e3d-bcb7-ec483293ff20",
                                                "sense_id": "d6927e4b-b599-30f5-91f7-93cfd4b7cd24",
                                                "text": "Paying yourself first also implies that you have some understanding of your cash flow, which means that, yes, you must set a budget."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6b5b4d82-e342-31d1-bfed-10d040417f8f",
                                        "entry_id": "c22bfa5b-0241-3ecb-b356-835909005b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Cash register, or the counter in a business where the cash register is located."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Canada",
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2f4a8a7e-b580-4025-aa84-b86894a4f4b3",
                                                "sense_id": "6b5b4d82-e342-31d1-bfed-10d040417f8f",
                                                "text": "Let me just bring these to the cash for you."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "29e62b0b-eddd-47cd-9d24-925e8787fd3b",
                                                "sense_id": "6b5b4d82-e342-31d1-bfed-10d040417f8f",
                                                "text": "Visit Apple’s jam-packed stores and you won’t see lines at the cash — because every sales clerk is also your cashier, using cellphone card-readers to zip you through."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a9497c02-ca1a-341d-948a-6c9cd5a9e54f",
                                        "entry_id": "c22bfa5b-0241-3ecb-b356-835909005b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An instance of winning a cash prize."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a33b0255-0612-4e4c-9120-5f57090e261c",
                                                "sense_id": "a9497c02-ca1a-341d-948a-6c9cd5a9e54f",
                                                "text": "In the WSOP, I have played around 150 tournaments with one final table, 11 cashes, and a -70 percent ROI."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0673e726-99bd-3dc6-a5f0-90bd2fd7d422",
                                        "entry_id": "c22bfa5b-0241-3ecb-b356-835909005b17",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A place where money is kept, or where it is deposited and paid out; a money box."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic",
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c0e6255-2827-4dfc-8512-d4019284db74",
                                                "sense_id": "0673e726-99bd-3dc6-a5f0-90bd2fd7d422",
                                                "text": "This bank[…] is properly a general cash, where every man lodges his money,"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51517ee8-9fe5-4147-b9f5-5c84845a0f2c",
                                                "sense_id": "0673e726-99bd-3dc6-a5f0-90bd2fd7d422",
                                                "text": "She was said to have amassed a great sum of money for ill use ; 20,000l. are known to be in her cash ;"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cash",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "80bd0778-4b5f-3845-abac-96eb94497ab7",
                                        "entry_id": "9dd6aca3-f1f4-3c1e-b553-2c627ef8097d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To exchange (a check/cheque) for money in the form of notes/bills."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "97096190-c2ca-48fe-9cd6-d749af154c28",
                                                "sense_id": "80bd0778-4b5f-3845-abac-96eb94497ab7",
                                                "text": "My single \"Lick and Move\" had made it to number four on the Top Ten charts, and I had gotten a nice check from Ruthless Rap. I cashed that shit and took Muddah shopping in Midtown and told her to get any damn thing she wanted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5f6af4a-9c35-3673-9d84-d6868c7d108c",
                                        "entry_id": "9dd6aca3-f1f4-3c1e-b553-2c627ef8097d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To obtain a payout from a tournament."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "cash",
